1
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:13,000
[narrator]
We are no different from the Ants.

2
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,000
No… we are far worse.

3
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:19,000
[dramatic music playing]

4
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:35,000
[glass clinks]

5
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:58,000
In survivors' bodies,
the poison was absorbed,

6
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:01,000
eating them away from the inside.

7
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:04,000
The rapid destruction of
their organs began soon after,

8
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:24,000
In other words…

9
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:42,000
[opening theme music playing]

10
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:26,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

11
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:42,000
[singer singing in English]

12
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:44,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

13
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:05,000
THE WORD X IS X YOU

14
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:07,000
[whooshing]

15
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:12,000
[splashes echo]

16
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:54,000
And if you have, then we must evacuate.

17
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:06,000
Very well.

18
00:05:07,000 --> 00:05:08,000
All that's left to do

19
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:12,000
is for me to locate and capture
all of the remaining intruders.

20
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:17,000
Your secret intrigues me and
I intend to know it soon enough.

21
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:31,000
I will keep my word, sire,
even if it costs me my life.

22
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:04,000
I can see all that has changed
since the first time I used En.

23
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:08,000
Footprints that weren't there before.

24
00:06:09,000 --> 00:06:10,000
An abandoned vehicle.

25
00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:14,000
Youpi's corpse.

26
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:17,000
A door that's been opened.

27
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:22,000
And someone new who reacts to my En!

28
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:41,000
Someone has killed Youpi, was it you?

29
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:43,000
[gasps]

30
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:47,000
No, sire! Absolutely not.

31
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:49,000
I am just a lowly Squadron Leader!

32
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:52,000
I respected Sir Youpi
and I had no reason to kill him!

33
00:06:59,000 --> 00:07:01,000
doubled over in pain, then he died.

34
00:07:14,000 --> 00:07:18,000
But then, before he could
even answer my question…

35
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:23,000
before my black centipedes
even had a chance to hatch,

36
00:07:23,000 --> 00:07:25,000
he was dead.

37
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:47,000
[grunts]

38
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:50,000
The Royal Guard Pouf. Oh, he's trouble.

39
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:05,000
Simply asking him to keep quiet
would be too lenient.

40
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:07,000
I should eliminate him immediately!

41
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:11,000
I should accuse him of disloyalty
and execute him.

42
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:15,000
In any case,
I must get him away from the King.

43
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:19,000
Lord Meruem, Welfin is--

44
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:21,000
[Meruem] I already know
what you're about to say.

45
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:23,000
[gasps]

46
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:27,000
I can now sense the emotions
of everyone who my En has touched,

47
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:48,000
[Shaiapouf] So it wasn't just
Youpi's wings and attacks,

48
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:51,000
the King also inherited
my Spiritual Message.

49
00:08:52,000 --> 00:08:57,000
Not only that, but it seems
he's made it infinitely more powerful.

50
00:08:57,000 --> 00:08:59,000
[gasps]

51
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:01,000
Sire!

52
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:06,000
The King is invincible!
The King is unrivaled!

53
00:09:07,000 --> 00:09:09,000
And yet…

54
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:11,000
[heart beating]

55
00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:13,000
Why?!

56
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:18,000
What is this feeling washing over me?

57
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:24,000
Why is my heart filled with such
overwhelming anxiety?

58
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:35,000
but there is no hiding the raw malice
that you feel for me.

59
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:36,000
It surges even now.

60
00:09:37,000 --> 00:09:43,000
Your hatred is undeniable, and I am quite
interested to learn what drives it.

61
00:09:54,000 --> 00:09:57,000
[Shaiapouf] This is no time
to let emotion best me!

62
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:13,000
[dramatic music playing]

63
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:26,000
He is deeply involved in my secret.

64
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:29,000
However, he has not yet realized this.

65
00:10:29,000 --> 00:10:31,000
Huh? Huh?

66
00:10:32,000 --> 00:10:35,000
[Shaiapouf] You may continue to question
him if you wish, sire.

67
00:10:44,000 --> 00:10:47,000
When the King has such power,
lies are futile.

68
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:49,000
I must rely on the truth!

69
00:10:50,000 --> 00:10:53,000
Although I am certain
you wish to receive your reward,

70
00:10:57,000 --> 00:11:00,000
I can use the truth to muddle the facts.

71
00:11:14,000 --> 00:11:17,000
Secret? What secret?

72
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:29,000
Damn it! I didn't realize
he was this powerful!

73
00:11:29,000 --> 00:11:31,000
I should have run away right off the bat.

74
00:11:31,000 --> 00:11:34,000
Ah! Temptation got the better of me!

75
00:11:34,000 --> 00:11:38,000
When I saw how Youpi had shrunken
from a giant down to the size of a bug,

76
00:11:38,000 --> 00:11:40,000
then dropped dead,

77
00:11:40,000 --> 00:11:43,000
I started thinking I might be
strong enough to take down the King.

78
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:47,000
Oh, but that was just a delusion.
That's why I stayed.

79
00:11:54,000 --> 00:11:55,000
I felt alive.

80
00:12:01,000 --> 00:12:04,000
In all the chaos that happened,
I remembered Gyro,

81
00:12:12,000 --> 00:12:17,000
But he isn't even dead.
Gyro is alive, he has to be!

82
00:12:17,000 --> 00:12:20,000
I should have run off
and teamed up with him again,

83
00:12:20,000 --> 00:12:22,000
then we could have sought revenge!

84
00:12:24,000 --> 00:12:25,000
Damn it!

85
00:12:25,000 --> 00:12:27,000
It's all that octopus' fault.

86
00:12:27,000 --> 00:12:29,000
That little bastard threw me off my game.

87
00:12:30,000 --> 00:12:32,000
He messed with my emotions.

88
00:12:32,000 --> 00:12:36,000
I let him lead me astray!
[groans] "Messenger," my ass!

89
00:12:43,000 --> 00:12:47,000
He'll send my head flying
before I can even activate Missileman!

90
00:12:48,000 --> 00:12:50,000
Think. What tools do I have left?

91
00:12:52,000 --> 00:12:55,000
The message? Pouf's secret?

92
00:12:55,000 --> 00:12:57,000
The root of my hatred?

93
00:13:04,000 --> 00:13:05,000
Whatever it is,

94
00:13:05,000 --> 00:13:09,000
the first word out of my mouth
will be crucial.

95
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:13,000
Just one word will decide
whether I live or die.

96
00:13:14,000 --> 00:13:17,000
If I choose the wrong one, it's all over!

97
00:13:38,000 --> 00:13:39,000
[Welfin gasps]

98
00:13:39,000 --> 00:13:42,000
Think carefully before you answer.

99
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:53,000
That will have consequences.

100
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:57,000
I must presume that you are prepared
for them.

101
00:13:57,000 --> 00:13:58,000
[Shaiapouf gasping]

102
00:13:59,000 --> 00:14:01,000
I want a sincere answer.

103
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:03,000
[Shaiapouf] This is…

104
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:08,000
[narrator] The King's new power
meant he had access to the answer.

105
00:14:13,000 --> 00:14:17,000
Although he understood that
he had Pouf's absolute devotion,

106
00:14:35,000 --> 00:14:39,000
each of these factors were equally
meaningless in the eyes of the King.

107
00:14:45,000 --> 00:14:47,000
[dramatic music playing]

108
00:14:47,000 --> 00:14:48,000
[Shaiapouf] Even then…

109
00:14:50,000 --> 00:14:52,000
I was prepared.

110
00:14:53,000 --> 00:14:57,000
I already knew that I was going to die.

111
00:15:03,000 --> 00:15:05,000
to my own loyalty.

112
00:15:14,000 --> 00:15:16,000
We are in the midst of our match.

113
00:15:33,000 --> 00:15:37,000
[narrator] His resolve
was nothing short of incredible.

114
00:15:41,000 --> 00:15:43,000
stopped the King in his tracks.

115
00:16:00,000 --> 00:16:02,000
[screams]

116
00:16:02,000 --> 00:16:05,000
…Welfin understood immediately.

117
00:16:06,000 --> 00:16:08,000
[Welfin] This is it.

118
00:16:24,000 --> 00:16:26,000
[Welfin] I'm dead.

119
00:16:27,000 --> 00:16:29,000
[narrator] Sensing his own fate,

120
00:16:29,000 --> 00:16:33,000
Welfin began to age, and within moments,

121
00:16:33,000 --> 00:16:36,000
it was as if a hundred years had passed.

122
00:16:36,000 --> 00:16:38,000
[Welfin] I want to live.

123
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:47,000
[narrator] In his mind, Welfin's entire
life passed by him in a jumbled flash,

124
00:17:01,000 --> 00:17:05,000
[narrator] Caught between the desire
to live and unavoidable death…

125
00:17:20,000 --> 00:17:21,000
Pouf's secret!

126
00:17:21,000 --> 00:17:23,000
One word!

127
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:25,000
I won't die.

128
00:17:25,000 --> 00:17:26,000
One word!

129
00:17:26,000 --> 00:17:28,000
Don't die until you're dead!

130
00:17:31,000 --> 00:17:34,000
[narrator] His brain worked feverishly
as it never had before

131
00:17:34,000 --> 00:17:37,000
and selected a word that,
under normal conditions,

132
00:17:37,000 --> 00:17:39,000
never would have occurred to him.

133
00:17:40,000 --> 00:17:42,000
[imperceptible]

134
00:18:15,000 --> 00:18:17,000
[imperceptible]

135
00:18:52,000 --> 00:18:53,000
[Shaiapouf] This…

136
00:19:01,000 --> 00:19:04,000
This is how intensely he cares for her.

137
00:19:12,000 --> 00:19:14,000
So this is your secret.

138
00:19:15,000 --> 00:19:17,000
[Shaiapouf] Yes.

139
00:19:22,000 --> 00:19:24,000
I will accept any punishment.

140
00:19:30,000 --> 00:19:33,000
[Meruem] You know what it shall be.
I do not have to speak it.

141
00:19:34,000 --> 00:19:38,000
You and I are of one mind.
I do not blame you.

142
00:19:39,000 --> 00:19:41,000
[Shaiapouf] I never had a chance.

143
00:19:43,000 --> 00:19:44,000
Yes.

144
00:19:44,000 --> 00:19:46,000
[Meruem] Continue searching for Pitou.

145
00:19:47,000 --> 00:19:50,000
The two captured intruders
may know something.

146
00:19:51,000 --> 00:19:53,000
Once you are done, let them go.

147
00:19:58,000 --> 00:20:01,000
[Shaiapouf] All I can do is nod in assent.

148
00:20:02,000 --> 00:20:04,000
Sire.

149
00:20:16,000 --> 00:20:18,000
Welfin…

150
00:20:31,000 --> 00:20:33,000
But how did you know that?

151
00:20:33,000 --> 00:20:34,000
[Meruem] I have come to believe

152
00:20:35,000 --> 00:20:38,000
that you took on the task
at the behest of the octopus.

153
00:20:39,000 --> 00:20:42,000
But I am unsure
why you failed to carry it out.

154
00:20:43,000 --> 00:20:47,000
Is it connected to your deep and
sudden hatred of me, by any chance?

155
00:20:47,000 --> 00:20:48,000
[gasps]

156
00:20:49,000 --> 00:20:51,000
[Meruem] Ah, yes.

157
00:20:51,000 --> 00:20:53,000
Now, please be at ease.

158
00:20:53,000 --> 00:20:57,000
Just answer my question, and
you are free to go wherever you wish.

159
00:20:59,000 --> 00:21:01,000
You have my thanks.

160
00:21:01,000 --> 00:21:05,000
It's because of you that I remembered
something important.

161
00:21:06,000 --> 00:21:07,000
[groans]

162
00:21:26,000 --> 00:21:28,000
you're enemies!

163
00:21:28,000 --> 00:21:29,000
Do you hear me?

164
00:21:32,000 --> 00:21:33,000
[Meruem] Is that so?

165
00:21:33,000 --> 00:21:34,000
[panting]

166
00:21:36,000 --> 00:21:39,000
I hope you see him. I truly do.

167
00:21:40,000 --> 00:21:42,000
And if possible…

168
00:21:44,000 --> 00:21:45,000
go live a human life.

169
00:21:47,000 --> 00:21:49,000
[Shaiapouf wails]

170
00:23:27,000 --> 00:23:29,000
[upbeat music playing]

171
00:23:31,000 --> 00:23:34,000
[Gon] Next time,
"This Person And This Moment."

172
00:23:42,000 --> 00:23:45,000
[singer singing in Japanese]
